  message: "Root cause identified: iter_tree's 11M Python function calls (per killbill, ~88M for Flink). Options: (1) tree-sitter cursor API — avoids node.children list allocation, ~5x faster, requires API change; (2) Cython — compiles iter_tree to C, ~10x faster, adds build complexity; (3) accept 25-30 min for 14K+ file repos. Recommend human decision on which approach to pursue."  # cda9
